  "source_checks": [
    {
      "check_id": "S1",
      "evidence_candidates": [
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T005",
          "quote": "For me, the main goal is transportation to get from one place to another.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 577,
          "end_char": 650
        }
      ],
      "candidate_ids": [
        "C001"
      ],
      "final_goal_ids": [
        "G001"
      ],
      "outcome": "represented",
      "reason": "主要目的原句直接映射到交通目标。"
    },
    {
      "check_id": "S2",
      "evidence_candidates": [
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T007",
          "quote": "When I've chosen to look for a ride, it's usually the amount of time it will take or the price in deciding whether or not to take ride.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 899,
          "end_char": 1034
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T007",
          "quote": "It's usually like whether or not I'm able to drive there or I want to drive there or if there are other better means of transportation, which kind of depends on again the price and duration.",
          "role": "context",
          "start_char": 1035,
          "end_char": 1225
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T007",
          "quote": "So if it's going to take like an hour and a half to get someplace. So I'll just walk even if it's kind of far away.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 1226,
          "end_char": 1341
        }
      ],
      "candidate_ids": [
        "C002",
        "C003"
      ],
      "final_goal_ids": [
        "G002",
        "G003"
      ],
      "outcome": "represented",
      "reason": "时间/价格判断与步行替代分别保留，前提与让步进入目标。"
    },
    {
      "check_id": "S3",
      "evidence_candidates": [
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T011",
          "quote": "I usually just go for The cheapest one, to be honest, unless if i'm going with more people",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 2491,
          "end_char": 2581
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T011",
          "quote": "I can also see a map with a couple different Ubers around. So I can know if there are other drivers near me.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 2767,
          "end_char": 2875
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T011",
          "quote": "if the price was too high, then I can choose to wait",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 2965,
          "end_char": 3017
        }
      ],
      "candidate_ids": [
        "C004",
        "C005",
        "C006"
      ],
      "final_goal_ids": [
        "G004",
        "G005",
        "G006"
      ],
      "outcome": "represented",
      "reason": "订车流程中的三个独立取舍分别建立目标。"
    },
    {
      "check_id": "S4",
      "evidence_candidates": [
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T013",
          "quote": "sometimes when I click okay and try to book that driver, it will take a really long time to actually schedule it. And sometimes it will end up saying that can't find a driver.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 3538,
          "end_char": 3713
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T013",
          "quote": "I usually try not to cancel a ride because I think that that damages my like the drivers will see a rating of the passenger as well.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 3938,
          "end_char": 4070
        }
      ],
      "candidate_ids": [
        "C007",
        "C008"
      ],
      "final_goal_ids": [
        "G007",
        "G008"
      ],
      "outcome": "represented",
      "reason": "匹配失败转为避免型目标，取消顾虑单列，未混为同一目标。"
    },
    {
      "check_id": "S5",
      "evidence_candidates": [
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T019",
          "quote": "Most of the time when I book or when I'm traveling for work or just traveling in general, I would probably prefer to rent a car.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 5148,
          "end_char": 5276
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T021",
          "quote": "But for the most part, I would choose to rent a car depending on the duration. So if I'm going on vacation for a week. And I know I'm going to need to be traveling a decent amount, then it would make more sense and give me a little bit more freedom to rent a car than to do a ride share every time I want to go someplace.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 6673,
          "end_char": 6994
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T019",
          "quote": "on the times where I have needed to to use a rideshare for work i usually care less about the price and more about the time in that case because my work is going to cover it.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 5377,
          "end_char": 5551
        }
      ],
      "candidate_ids": [
        "C009",
        "C010"
      ],
      "final_goal_ids": [
        "G009",
        "G010"
      ],
      "outcome": "represented",
      "reason": "租车偏好与工作出行时间优先分别承接，条件保留。"
    },
    {
      "check_id": "S6",
      "evidence_candidates": [
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T021",
          "quote": "So I usually do take a bus for my like planned route. So for work, it's fairly simple. My work gives me a free bus pass, basically.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 5986,
          "end_char": 6117
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T021",
          "quote": "Because I don't want to take a bus in a place I'm not familiar with",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 6254,
          "end_char": 6321
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T021",
          "quote": "there are a lot of there are a lot of places where either it would take a really long time to take the bus or it just um you have to like end up walking someplace or take a couple different Like. other buses. And so if it's complicated like that, I would probably prefer And Uber in that case.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 6379,
          "end_char": 6672
        }
      ],
      "candidate_ids": [
        "C011",
        "C012",
        "C013"
      ],
      "final_goal_ids": [
        "G011",
        "G012",
        "G013"
      ],
      "outcome": "represented",
      "reason": "公交常规使用、陌生地区回避与复杂路线改叫车分为三项。"
    },
    {
      "check_id": "S7",
      "evidence_candidates": [
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T025",
          "quote": "I have used it. That is something that I have had bad experiences with, so I've stopped using it.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 7337,
          "end_char": 7434
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T029",
          "quote": "It was a mixture of a bad estimate poorly estimating the amount of time And then the customer service dealing with that was extraordinarily poor.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 7772,
          "end_char": 7917
        }
      ],
      "candidate_ids": [
        "C014"
      ],
      "final_goal_ids": [
        "G014"
      ],
      "outcome": "represented",
      "reason": "停止使用 Uber Eats 的明确决定保留，糟糕体验作为理由。"
    },
    {
      "check_id": "S8",
      "evidence_candidates": [
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T031",
          "quote": "I found it very difficult because I wanted to talk to a person",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 8154,
          "end_char": 8216
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T031",
          "quote": "if you actually want to actually resolve an issue, you're probably going to need more than what they're like",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 8349,
          "end_char": 8457
        }
      ],
      "candidate_ids": [
        "C015"
      ],
      "final_goal_ids": [
        "G015"
      ],
      "outcome": "represented",
      "reason": "想与真人对话的诉求推断为人工客服目标，未当作已实现的现状。"
    },
    {
      "check_id": "S9",
      "evidence_candidates": [
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T037",
          "quote": "Most of the time, if I'm going to use Uber, I would prefer to just go to one location versus going to multiple ones.",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 9755,
          "end_char": 9871
        },
        {
          "source_id": "DOC026:T037",
          "quote": "I always feel weird if I'm going to do that where one of the in-between stops takes too much time So I try to to do anything like that. I try to make it as quick as possible",
          "role": "basis",
          "start_char": 9938,
          "end_char": 10111
        }
      ],
      "candidate_ids": [
        "C016",
        "C017"
      ],
      "final_goal_ids": [
        "G016",
        "G017"
